# Change Request

## Title
Refactor Security Rights Enum

## Type
Code improvement / Maintainability fix

## Description
The current Right.java file contains many permissions for different system modules. This makes it difficult to read, maintain, and extend.

The change will introduce separate enums:
- CourseRight
- EventRight
- RoomRight

Each enum will represent permissions related to one subsystem.

## Expected Benefit
- Better code organization
- Easier maintenance
- Clearer subsystem boundaries
- Lower risk when adding new permissions
